{"id":"u-df128ecf-7db5-4615-acc6-d0fdd4e494cd","src":"community","title":"Saiyan Training Protocol - PPLUL Powerbuilding","author":"Attila B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ltXkql-saiyan-training-protocol","desc":"The saiyan training protocol is designed with a lifter in mind who wants to focus on their strenght, muscle and performance metrics.\n\nThe strenght base is covered with the first 3 days of the program. The main and secondary lifts get a linear progression from ~60% to ~90%. Each week we should raise about 1-3% of our lifts for our top sets. The backdowns should be based on the RPE of our main lift. This could be about -10% to -20% taken off our main lifts based ln performance. The backdowns should be close to our top sets in rep count.\n\nThe accessories were chosen to get a strong upper back, traps, and shoulders, basically a yoke focused program. This is inspired from the saiyans and olympic lifters physique which in my opinion are closely resembed by each other.\n\nIn the excercise seleciton you can see the inspiration from oly lifting - upright rows, presses, rdls, weighted calisthenics.\n\nEvery rep should have a slow, controlled descent with an explosive concentric. Skill mastery is crucial you aren't just swinging weight, you are wielding it with purpase.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:33:35.687Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull strength","Push strength","Leg strength","Upper hypertrophy","Lower - Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":1,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}],"note":"Start at about 60% for a topset, based on rpe take -10-20% and do backoffs. \n\nAdd 1-3% every week until 90% \n\nAt 90% go for a single or rep PR"},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":1,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}],"note":"Same as first excercise"},{"n":"Kroc Row","sets"